A mod for Crusader Kings 3 allowing players to grant any character immortality, and providing utilities for playing immortal rulers.

Based on the currently abandoned Immortality mod by Slightly Productive https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2217002908

This mod is open source! Feel free to report issues, suggest features, and contribute at https://github.com/paige404/CK3_Immortality

Localizers welcome! I'm happy to talk anyone who wants to contribute localization through the process of making a pull request. Rather than splitting the mod up into several localized versions that all need to be separately maintained, contribution through the GitHub will allow us to keep all the localization on the one mod.

[b]How to Use[/b]
Either right click your ruler and select Grant Immortality, or select the Immortal trait from the trait list during character creation

[b]F.A.Q[/b]

“My ruler died to mysterious circumstances despite being immortal???”

- Immortality makes you immune to aging and difficult to kill. But not impossible to kill. Stay sexy, don't get murdered.
